Job Title: Front-End Developer

About the Role:
We are seeking a talented Front-End Developer to build engaging, responsive
user interfaces for our web applications. You will work closely with
designers and back-end developers to deliver seamless user experiences.

Responsibilities:
- Develop responsive web interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript
- Build reusable components using React and Redux
- Translate UI/UX designs and Figma mockups into functional code
- Optimize applications for maximum speed and performance
- Collaborate with back-end developers integrating Node.js and MongoDB
- Ensure cross-browser compatibility and responsive design
- Participate in code reviews and maintain a component library

Requirements:
- 2+ years of experience in front-end web development
- Strong proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React
- Experience with Redux and Bootstrap
- Familiarity with UI/UX design principles and tools like Figma
- Basic understanding of Node.js and MongoDB
- Experience with Git and version control
- Good eye for design and attention to detail

Nice to Have:
- Experience with responsive design frameworks
- Familiarity with Photoshop or other design tools
- Understanding of website performance optimization
